### Full snapshot of the world (grid + objects + HEAD + branch)
GET {{host}}/repo/snapshot
Accept: application/json

### Where the world repo and its .git dir live (for the client-side .git reader)
GET {{host}}/repo/paths
Accept: application/json

### Repo status (branch, HEAD sha, dirty?) — should be cheap (<10 ms)
GET {{host}}/repo/status
Accept: application/json

### Commit log (default: HEAD, limit 50)
GET {{host}}/repo/log
Accept: application/json

### Commit log on a specific branch
GET {{host}}/repo/log?branch=red-faction&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### All branches with ahead/behind vs main
GET {{host}}/repo/branches
Accept: application/json

### All branches with ahead/behind vs a different base
GET {{host}}/repo/branches?compareTo=red-faction
Accept: application/json

### Delta between two refs (added/removed/modified objects)
GET {{host}}/repo/diff?from=HEAD~1&to=HEAD
Accept: application/json

### Delta between two branches
GET {{host}}/repo/diff?from=main&to=red-faction
Accept: application/json
